{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Rudra, an explorer who dares to uncover the dark secret buried within an ancient castle in the Western Ghats.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was once a place of royal grace now echoes with chants, cries, and the whispers of a woman long forgotten \u2014 Nilawanti.<br>Solve puzzles, uncover lost relics, and piece together the fragments of her cursed history in this <strong>MYSTERY-HORROR ADVENTURE</strong> set deep within India\u2019s past.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/0d254f77422377d54b4a0657aaf99a1a.poster.avif?t=1761911845\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/0d254f77422377d54b4a0657aaf99a1a.webm?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/0d254f77422377d54b4a0657aaf99a1a.mp4?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Cursed Castle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, this castle belonged to a royal family obsessed with forbidden rituals and the pursuit of immortality. When Nilawanti entered their lives, everything changed. The castle fell silent\u2026 the family vanished\u2026 and her name was erased from history.<br>Now, the place stands untouched \u2014 its walls breathing, its corridors echoing, and its shadows hiding the truth that everyone feared to speak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/f511e3ac7e7eefe2b2cb4c53d4ec0ea7.poster.avif?t=1761911845\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/f511e3ac7e7eefe2b2cb4c53d4ec0ea7.webm?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/f511e3ac7e7eefe2b2cb4c53d4ec0ea7.mp4?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nilawanti</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a devoted woman, Nilawanti was drawn into a ritual that went terribly wrong.<br>Her soul was bound to the castle \u2014 restless, vengeful, and searching for the sacred scripture known as the <i>Granth.</i><br>She appears in reflections, whispers behind closed doors, and hunts anyone who dares to uncover what she lost.<br>You must face her \u2014 not just to survive, but to understand what really happened that night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Investigation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Rudra</strong>, you are not just an explorer \u2014 you are a seeker of truth.<br>Find ancient manuscripts, decode cryptic puzzles, and survive the supernatural forces protecting Nilawanti\u2019s secret.<br>Every artifact you collect brings you closer to the final ritual \u2014 and every wrong move brings her closer to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2751 Explore the castle\u2019s forgotten chambers and eerie halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/4a06fe3aea1fff2d32aa20f98bb47961.poster.avif?t=1761911845\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/4a06fe3aea1fff2d32aa20f98bb47961.webm?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/4a06fe3aea1fff2d32aa20f98bb47961.mp4?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2751 Solve puzzles to unlock the path to the sacred <i>Granth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/253892af5d132558a53f28df4a46c464.poster.avif?t=1761911845\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/253892af5d132558a53f28df4a46c464.webm?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/253892af5d132558a53f28df4a46c464.mp4?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2751 Avoid Nilawanti\u2019s wrath \u2014 hide, breathe quietly, and stay in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/ae277c9177cbe03fb9c762bcb2b70e9a.poster.avif?t=1761911845\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/ae277c9177cbe03fb9c762bcb2b70e9a.webm?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/ae277c9177cbe03fb9c762bcb2b70e9a.mp4?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2751 Discover the truth behind her curse\u2026 and the price of setting her free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/553cbff2902eabfd15912ddcff3a3aac.poster.avif?t=1761911845\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/553cbff2902eabfd15912ddcff3a3aac.webm?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/553cbff2902eabfd15912ddcff3a3aac.mp4?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nilawanti: A Cursed Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow-burning, story-driven horror experience rooted in Indian mythology and tragedy.<br>Will you uncover the truth\u2026 or become another soul trapped within her curse?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087690?t=1761911845","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087690?t=1761911845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/12624b0a549c5933b2979ab765f9f8d5115d7b6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761911845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/12624b0a549c5933b2979ab765f9f8d5115d7b6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761911845","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are Rudra, an explorer who dares to uncover the dark secret buried within an ancient castle in the Western Ghats.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was once a place of royal grace now echoes with chants, cries, and the whispers of a woman long forgotten \u2014 Nilawanti.<br>Solve puzzles, uncover lost relics, and piece together the fragments of her cursed history in this <strong>MYSTERY-HORROR ADVENTURE</strong> set deep within India\u2019s past.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/0d254f77422377d54b4a0657aaf99a1a.poster.avif?t=1761911845\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/0d254f77422377d54b4a0657aaf99a1a.webm?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/0d254f77422377d54b4a0657aaf99a1a.mp4?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Cursed Castle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, this castle belonged to a royal family obsessed with forbidden rituals and the pursuit of immortality. When Nilawanti entered their lives, everything changed. The castle fell silent\u2026 the family vanished\u2026 and her name was erased from history.<br>Now, the place stands untouched \u2014 its walls breathing, its corridors echoing, and its shadows hiding the truth that everyone feared to speak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/f511e3ac7e7eefe2b2cb4c53d4ec0ea7.poster.avif?t=1761911845\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/f511e3ac7e7eefe2b2cb4c53d4ec0ea7.webm?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087690/extras/f511e3ac7e7eefe2b2cb4c53d4ec0ea7.mp4?t=1761911845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nilawanti</strong></h2><p class=